@startuml
title FT-002-04 / #68 — pre-task evidence intake (target sequence, not existing API)
actor "Ученик" as Student
participant "Vue DiagnosticEvidencePanel" as UI
participant "EvidenceController" as API
participant "EvidenceService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Safe media storage\n(#20/#30 adapter)" as Store
participant "Unified media lifecycle\n(#21)" as TTL

Student -> UI: Открыть диагностику
UI -> API: GET /evidence/capabilities и GET /evidence
API -> Service: Проверить learner/session ownership
Service -> DB: SELECT session/evidence
DB --> Service: COLLECTING_EVIDENCE + список
Service --> API: EvidenceView[] / capabilities
API --> UI: 200
UI --> Student: Пусто либо список, загрузить / пропустить

alt Ученик прикладывает исполнение
    Student -> UI: title + audio + optional score
    UI -> UI: local audio preview, явная отправка
    UI -> API: POST /evidence multipart + requestId
    API -> Service: submit(learnerId, sessionId, requestId)
    Service -> DB: BEGIN + lock session row
    Service -> DB: ownership, status, unique(requestId), quota
    alt повторный requestId
        DB --> Service: Existing evidence
        Service --> API: Existing EvidenceView
        API --> UI: 200, без нового файла
    else новая запись и COLLECTING_EVIDENCE
        Service -> Store: validate + store(audio)
        Store --> Service: generated audio key
        opt score supplied
            Service -> Store: validate + store(score, document policy)
            Store --> Service: generated score key
        end
        Service -> DB: INSERT evidence + evidence_media; FLUSH; COMMIT
        alt commit successful
            DB --> Service: COMMITTED
            Service -> TTL: Track audio + optional score under common policy
            Service --> API: EvidenceView
            API --> UI: 201 + Location
        else confirmed rollback / second file error
            DB --> Service: ROLLED_BACK
            Service -> Store: compensate all stored keys
            Service --> API: Allowlisted error
            API --> UI: 4xx/5xx; keep draft
        else commit outcome unknown
            DB --> Service: UNKNOWN
            Service -> TTL: Reconcile without deleting referenced media
            Service --> API: Safe transient error
            API --> UI: 503; retry using requestId
        end
    else READY_FOR_TASK or TASK_ASSIGNED
        Service --> API: 409 INVALID_SESSION_STATE
        API --> UI: Refresh session, no upload
    end
else без собственной записи
    Student -> UI: Перейти к заданиям
    UI -> API: POST /diagnostic-sessions/{sessionId}/continue (existing)
    API -> Service: Existing session transition
    Service -> DB: lock session + COLLECTING_EVIDENCE -> READY_FOR_TASK
    API --> UI: SessionView
end
note over Service,DB
  Upload and continue serialize on the same session lock.
  No fake taskId, no confirmed skill from uploaded media.
end note
note over Store,TTL
  Private audio/score deleted by 48h-after-finalization policy.
  Metadata survives. Educational catalog is excluded.
end note
@enduml
